<dialog class="sheet" id="report" aria-labelledby="report-title">
  <form class="sheet-in" novalidate id="report-form" data-tomb-id="">
    <h2 id="report-title">举报这块碑</h2>
    <p>
      举报需要审核，不会立刻隐藏。如果这是你自己的碑，去“管理我的墓碑”撤回会更快。
    </p>
    <fieldset class="field">
      <legend>原因</legend>
      <div class="seg">
        <label>
          <input type="radio" name="reason" value="privacy" checked />{' '}
          含隐私信息
        </label>
        <label>
          <input type="radio" name="reason" value="abuse" />{' '}
          辱骂、骚扰或恶意内容
        </label>
        <label>
          <input type="radio" name="reason" value="gray_market" /> 灰产广告
        </label>
        <label>
          <input type="radio" name="reason" value="other" /> 其他
        </label>
      </div>
    </fieldset>
    <div class="field" style="margin-top:14px">
      <label for="report-note">
        补充说明<span class="req">选填，最多 200 字</span>
      </label>
      <textarea
        class="textarea"
        id="report-note"
        maxlength="200"
        style="min-height:90px"
      ></textarea>
    </div>
    <div
      class="turnstile-slot"
      id="report-turnstile"
      data-turnstile-sitekey=""
      style="margin:14px 0"
      aria-label="人机验证"
    ></div>
    <div
      class="banner banner-error"
      id="report-error"
      role="alert"
      hidden
    ></div>
    <div class="actions">
      <button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">
        提交举报
      </button>
      <button class="btn btn-quiet" id="cancel-report" type="button">
        算了
      </button>
    </div>
  </form>
</dialog>
